								"html": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\"><h4> </h4>\n\n<h4> </h4>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#005788;\">Ways you can support our community.</span></h4>\n\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Give as you are able of your time, resources and care.</span></h5>\n\n<hr>\n<p>\n\t \n</p>\n\n<div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Donate Money</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tYour donations to The Salvation Army Central Virginia stay local and help us serve the most vulnerable members of your community. \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<em><strong>You may also mail donations to:</strong></em><br>\n\t\t\t\t\tThe Salvation Army Central Virginia<br>\n\t\t\t\t\tP.O. Box 12400, Richmond VA 23241\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><a href=\"https://give.virginiasalvationarmy.org/give/302275/#!/donation/checkout\" class=\"btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2\">Donate Now</a></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Bonds, Funds, Stocks and IRA Rollover</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tYou can make a gift of your bonds, funds, stocks and other securities to help those who need it most. <a href=\"mailto:kim.wentz@uss.salvationarmy.org\" target=\"\">Email Kim Wentz</a>, Regional Resource Development Director, or call <a href=\"tel:8044005992\">(804) 400-5992</a>.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><a href=\"mailto:kim.wentz@uss.salvationarmy.org\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Give Today</a></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Planned Giving, Wills and Gift Annuities</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tYou can provide hope for the future with the gift of a planned donation. <a href=\"mailto:patrick.mcauliffe@uss.salvationarmy.org\" target=\"\">Email R</a><a href=\"mailto:rachel.martin@uss.salvationarmy.org\" target=\"\">achel Martin</a>, Associate Planned Giving Director, or call <a href=\"tel:2027563962\">(202) 756-3962</a>.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:patrick.mcauliffe@uss.salvationarmyorg\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Leave a Legacy</a></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"row row-2\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Shelter Needs</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tOur shelter operates 365 days a year and so do our shelter needs. See how you can fulfill a need and do the Most Good with a simple click. Items ship directly to our shelter.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><a href=\"https://bit.ly/SalArmyRVAShelterRegistry\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Shelter Needs Registry</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Volunteer My Time</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tThanks to generous community support, The Salvation Army Central Virginia Area Command is able to make a powerful impact on our community by serving those in need. \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><a href=\"https://cvac.salvationarmypotomac.org/centralvirginia/volunteer\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Volunteer</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Support our Youth Programs</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tOur mission is to enable all young people, especially those who need us most, to reach their full potential as productive, caring and responsible citizens. Empower youth at our Red Shield Youth Center and Corps/church music and arts programs.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><a href=\"https://give.virginiasalvationarmy.org/give/473302/#!/donation/checkout\" class=\"btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2\">Support Our Youth</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"row row-3\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>\n\t \n</p></div>",
